<p>
God of Grace,
</p>

<p>
When Jesus was offered<br>
the choice to be used<br>
or to be silent,
</p>

<p>
He chose silence.
</p>

<p>
May I guard against<br>
the temptation to craft<br>
an image of Jesus to use<br>
for my own political<br>
and personal use.
</p>

<p>
Thy will, not my own, Lord.
</p>

<p>
<i>Amen</i>
</p>



